The test scenario: There's a tabs component with three tabs: Account (selected initially), Notifications (disabled), Billing (enabled but not selected). When pressing ArrowRight from Account, expected outcome: skip over disabled Notifications tab and select Billing (so #tab-billing gets aria-selected="true", focused, and billing pane becomes visible).

